1
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:42,320
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:47,550
[Episode 5:
I'll Take Responsibility for You]

3
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,880
It's late. No staying here at night.

4
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,560
Who left the boat here?

5
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:11,480
How did she somehow

6
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,260
find her way into my heart?

7
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,080
Why are you looking at me?

8
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,400
I'm looking at...

9
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:30,960
My man.

10
00:01:37,759 --> 00:01:38,490
Don't worry.

11
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:42,420
I'll take responsibility for you.

12
00:01:42,650 --> 00:01:44,490
You've said it all.

13
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,240
What am I supposed to say?

14
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:14,990
[Stock Exchange]

15
00:02:15,010 --> 00:02:17,579
[VIP Trading Room No. 1]

16
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:31,200
Shencheng Development Bank
looks set for a correction.

17
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:33,800
It's not a good time
to buy in for the short term.

18
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:35,160
You have a point.

19
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,360
But in the long run,

20
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:40,440
with policy incentives
continuing to take effect,

21
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,840
there's still plenty of room
for it to rise.

22
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:46,060
I rarely see women at the stock exchange,

23
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,360
especially a young woman like you

24
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,880
who's so insightful.

25
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,040
What a shame, though.

26
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,620
Your eye for the stock market is good,

27
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:58,010
but it's not enough to match
the stature of a wealthy family.

28
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,360
Hong.

29
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,360
Nanfeng.

30
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,960
This is my mother.

31
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,300
Nice to meet you, Hong.

32
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,480
Your employee has a good eye.

33
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:19,560
She has some
very original ideas about stocks.

34
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:22,740
This is my girlfriend,

35
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:23,880
Xie Nanfeng.

36
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:36,440
Why did you bring
this piece of gutter mud back?

37
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:37,720
Hong.

38
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,040
Nanfeng.

39
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,040
Don't get the wrong idea.

40
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:47,560
My mother may simply
not know you well enough.

41
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,360
Don't worry.

42
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,250
I'll make sure she accepts you.

43
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:52,960
Accepts me?

44
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,480
Why do I need to be accepted?

45
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:58,000
Is there some hurdle between us

46
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,000
that we need your family's approval

47
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,360
to get past?

48
00:04:01,110 --> 00:04:02,440
That's not what I meant.

49
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,520
I care about you as a person.

50
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,050
Nothing else matters to me.

51
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,040
Why are you getting so worked up?

52
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,970
I never said I wouldn't accept you.

53
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,560
However,

54
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,450
if you really want my approval,

55
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,040
it won't be that easy.

56
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,769
I'm going to put you to the test.

57
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:23,360
Okay.

58
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:25,960
I'd be happy to.

59
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,920
Test me however you like.

60
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,500
I'll see it through to the end.

61
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:36,120
I knew from the start
that he came from a privileged family.

62
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,600
I had already imagined
all kinds of possibilities.

63
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,560
Chu Chunsheng,

64
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:42,360
thank you for choosing me
without hesitation.

65
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,480
But in this life,

66
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:46,170
I won't cling to anyone's status or power.

67
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:48,940
I only want to become
a better version of myself.

68
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:06,160
I'm very pleased with your design.

69
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:07,640
The styles are innovative,

70
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:08,800
the fabrics are well suited,

71
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,840
and it fits our brand's
positioning perfectly.

72
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,960
It even exceeded my expectations.

73
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:13,960
Thank you.

74
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:17,360
When designing it, I focused on

75
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,160
what women today truly want from beauty

76
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,640
as well as what they
genuinely need in life.

77
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:25,470
Here's the deposit.

78
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,820
Ten thousand yuan.

79
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:29,850
We'll work together based on this design.

80
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,810
I certainly won't let you down.

81
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,560
Good.

82
00:05:53,409 --> 00:05:54,290
Good news.

83
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:06,330
Twenty percent of the gains
from Shencheng Development Bank.

84
00:06:06,330 --> 00:06:07,400
That's 200,000 yuan in total.

85
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,060
It's yours.

86
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:15,000
Then I guess we should celebrate properly.

87
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:26,380
Mr. Chu, we have to thank you
for your connections in Harboria.

88
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,160
On a day like this,

89
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,760
why don't we have a drink?

90
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:38,670
[Emergency Ultrasound Room]

91
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,560
Miss Xie,

92
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:40,220
you're 2 months pregnant.

93
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,960
There's something

94
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:46,400
I need to tell you.

95
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:00,960
Hello?

96
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,280
Miss Xie,

97
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:06,960
I'm terribly sorry.

98
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,080
About that order,

99
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:09,560
we won't be able
to work with you after all.

100
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,000
We don't need the deposit either.

101
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,400
Consider it compensation for the trouble.

102
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:15,680
Wait.

103
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,480
Why?

104
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,880
There was nothing wrong

105
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,320
with our design
or our communication process.

106
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:21,240
Why?

107
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:22,960
To be honest,

108
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:25,130
we've hired an American designer.

109
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:26,860
After discussing it, we felt

110
00:07:26,860 --> 00:07:29,440
foreigners understand
fashion trends better.

111
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,080
Miss Xie,

112
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,360
I'm truly sorry.

113
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,940
It's already settled.

114
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,800
If I want to go further,

115
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,960
I guess I'll have to study abroad.

116
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,400
You ungrateful wretch!

117
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,280
You're making a fortune out there,

118
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,840
but you don't care
about your family at all.

119
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:47,760
I'm telling you,

120
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:48,840
if you don't give us the money today,

121
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:49,840
you're not going anywhere.

122
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:52,040
The written agreement is crystal clear.

123
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:54,320
I've already cut ties with you.

124
00:07:54,340 --> 00:07:55,480
What written agreement?

125
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,320
What are you talking about?

126
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,260
I don't acknowledge it!

127
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:58,360
Playing dumb, are you?

128
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,480
Your brother has kidney disease.

129
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,400
He needs a kidney transplant.

130
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,880
Come to the hospital with us
and get tested for compatibility.

131
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:03,320
He's your son.

132
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,440
You get tested yourselves.

133
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:06,100
This has nothing to do with me.

134
00:08:06,410 --> 00:08:07,170
Besides,

135
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:09,050
didn't you
already turn out to be a match?

136
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:11,600
You're a young woman.
Donating a kidney won't hurt you.

137
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,320
You can't expect

138
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,330
a man like me
to donate a kidney, can you?

139
00:08:14,330 --> 00:08:15,370
Exactly.

140
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,320
Even if you don't care
about me, your stepmother,

141
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:19,840
at least do it for your father,
who gave you life.

142
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:20,920
Come with us now.

143
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,760
I'll say it one last time.

144
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,090
Get tested yourselves.

145
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,720
I'm not going anywhere with you.

146
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,360
Everyone, come and see this!

147
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,520
There's no justice in this world!

148
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:32,240
Her own brother is fighting for his life,

149
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,280
and she won't help him!

150
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,280
Come take a look! Come take a look!

151
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:35,640
What an ungrateful wretch!

152
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,840
She's trying to drive me to my death!

153
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,799
You ungrateful wretch!

154
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:38,400
You...

155
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,200
Haven't I already given you money?

156
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,520
I told you to stop harassing her,

157
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,780
or you'll have to face the consequences.

158
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:49,440
Biao.

159
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:05,520
No, no, no.

160
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,400
We haven't forgotten. We haven't.

161
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:08,660
We're leaving right now. We're leaving.

162
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:11,960
They've...

163
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,220
been asking you for money?

164
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:21,160
Why didn't you tell me?

165
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:22,840
It wasn't much.

166
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,400
I figured paying them off
would buy you some peace.

167
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:29,090
Paying them off would buy me peace?

168
00:09:32,250 --> 00:09:34,280
Do you really think that paying them off
will make them leave me alone?

169
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,960
This is what my family is like.

170
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,200
They're never satisfied.

171
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,520
They're a bunch of
ungrateful, insatiable people.

172
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:40,600
Today, you gave them money,

173
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,200
and yeah,

174
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,280
they left me alone for now.

175
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,680
But what about tomorrow?

176
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,800
They'll keep hounding me endlessly,

177
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,080
for the rest of my life.

178
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,480
Hounding me.

179
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:54,080
So they're treating you like this,

180
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,740
and I'm supposed to
just stand by and do nothing?

181
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,480
If I want to break free
from the tragedy of my past life,

182
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,010
the problems with my family

183
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,380
are something I have to solve myself.

184
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,340
Chu Chunsheng,

185
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,450
it's time for us to say goodbye.

186
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:22,280
Take your money.

187
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:23,600
From now on, we're even.

188
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,400
Nanfeng.

189
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:25,880
Stop this.

190
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,720
We don't need to keep
such a strict account between us.

191
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,320
We have to keep things clear.

192
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:37,680
Thank you.

193
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:42,170
I'm sorry you had to
see me like this today.

194
00:10:43,070 --> 00:10:43,680
I'm exhausted today.

195
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:44,360
I'm leaving now.
